{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform into a magical girl and raise adorable gem bunnies on your very own moon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunarity is a cozy simulation game where caring for gem bunnies unlocks powerful spells for tactical hex-grid battles. Each happy bunny grants you a hex gem to build your deck of spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/9206a7fc4f1d86d8cc0e60e813a837ba.poster.avif?t=1755597542\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/9206a7fc4f1d86d8cc0e60e813a837ba.webm?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/9206a7fc4f1d86d8cc0e60e813a837ba.mp4?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bunnies need you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow their food, play mini games with them, and shower them with affection.  <br>Happy bunnies share their power with you - neglect them, and their magic fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/1599aa0e48fea2cdb62d571c47c9965a.poster.avif?t=1755597542\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/1599aa0e48fea2cdb62d571c47c9965a.webm?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/1599aa0e48fea2cdb62d571c47c9965a.mp4?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When enemies threaten to steal your bunnies, transform and battle on tactical hex-grids! <br>Use your bunny-powered deck to guide critters to safety. Master elemental magic as you outsmart your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/aaf0560135365e095be1b3bc90fd5b05.poster.avif?t=1755597542\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/aaf0560135365e095be1b3bc90fd5b05.webm?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/extras/aaf0560135365e095be1b3bc90fd5b05.mp4?t=1755597542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the academy to learn new abilities, meet fellow magical girls, and build relationships with them. Attend classes, participate in events, and expand your magical knowledge alongside other guardians. Form teams with other magical girls and fight evil side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm and peaceful creature care meets tactical hex battles (but no time pressure, don't worry)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic deckbuilding powered by creature happiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different moons and assist other magical girls protecting their cute creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with other magical girls at the academy</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851410?t=1755597542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851410/3016a40e901d3fff0ad1be2b59ae476bed76c9be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755597542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i